    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "11. A) They are less likely to choose a vegetarian dish.\nB) They find vegetarian dishes become more appealing.\nC) They tend to consume larger portions of unhealthy food.\nD) They are less likely to choose dishes recommended by chefs.",
