    {
      "block_label": "text",
      "block_content": "12. A) They have found a solution to the global problem of air pollution.\nB) They have managed to freeze polluting particles to around -18°C.\nC) They have been seeking a way to prevent pollutants from penetrating indoors.\nD) They have been cooperating closely on developing a new type of air-condition",
      "block_bbox": [
        69,
        357,
        787,
